  "implementation": [
    "D uses its existing all-rank request ticket and cohort lease, owner-local arenas/writers, and all-owner receipt agreement.",
    "Single-rank and cohort decode coordinators share the fenced first-teacher import. Each KV owner exports its local canonical head range; the aux owner alone stores teacher/positions.",
    "Aux-only and inactive ranks advance the same first-token ledger. A TP4 CPU fixture with two replicated physical heads validates canonical ownership and exact reconstruction.",
    "P/D global teacher/KV contract digests do not depend on local TP layout. P validates all non-dummy destination contexts; D rejects missing, stale or conflicting handoffs.",
    "The capability gate now permits TP for AR Mooncake PD and retains the PP/DP/speculation/optimistic-prefill exclusions."
  ],
